carbonenginejs/format-stl
=========================

A pure-JavaScript format package for STL triangle meshes. It exposes read,
write, and printability inspection helpers for the shared CarbonEngineJS JSON
geometry schema.

Contains no CarbonEngine or Fenris Creations (CCP Games) code. STL itself is
not a CarbonEngine or CCP format; CarbonEngine and Fenris Creations (CCP Games)
are named here because this package's JSON input/output shape is designed for
CarbonEngineJS interoperability.

No CarbonEngine or Fenris Creations (CCP Games) source files, tooling,
proprietary documentation, shaders, or assets are included in this repository.

This package is not affiliated with or endorsed by CCP Games.

